  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Grepan village support through sustainable sources of water and training</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Grepan village support through sustainable sources of water and training</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Cie&#x13E;om mikrograntu je zlep&#x161;enie &#x17E;ivotn&#xFD;ch podmienok obyvate&#x13E;ov obce Greppan, vr&#xE1;tane komunity vn&#xFA;torne vys&#xED;dlen&#xFD;ch obyvate&#x13E;ov zabezpe&#x10D;en&#xED; 37 filtra&#x10D;n&#xFD;ch zariaden&#xED; na vodu pre dom&#xE1;cnosti a 1 chladiaceho zariadenia pre z&#xE1;kladn&#xFA; &#x161;kolu, ako zvy&#x161;ovanie povedomia o pitnom re&#x17E;ime a osobnej hygiene medzi obyvate&#x13E;mi.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to improve living conditions for host and IDP communities by installing 37 water filter devices fo villagers and filter cooling device for a primary school and raise awareness of drinking habits and hygiene among pupil and inhabitants.</narrative>
  </description>
